<title>USA: XCL, Apache start Chinese well.</title>
<headline>XCL, Apache start Chinese well.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>XCL Ltd said drilling started Tuesday on the F(a) exploration well in the Zhao Dong Block, China.</p>
<p>The F(a) is being directionally drilled into Bohai Bay from a surface location on the shoreline, XCL said.</p>
<p>XCL and Apache Corp, the operator, each owns a 50 percent interest in the Foreign Contractor's share of the Zhao Dong Block. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
